== Equipment ==
* Blessed Armor
* Vitae or Attunement runes
* Zealous Scythe of Enchanting
* High Energy Staff for running
* Longbow
* For A/N variant at Gloop:
** Any Martial Weapon of Enchanting (containing +5 Energy)
** Shield of Fortitude (+10 vs. Cold)

